CREATE TABLE "User" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"username" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"passwordHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"displayName" TEXT NOT NULL,"heightCm" INTEGER,"startingWeightKg" DECIMAL(6,2),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "Exercise" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"nameEn" TEXT NOT NULL,"nameDe" TEXT NOT NULL,"nameRu" TEXT,"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"instructions" TEXT NOT NULL,"targetMuscles" TEXT[] NOT NULL,"equipmentType" TEXT NOT NULL,"exerciseType" TEXT NOT NULL,"defaultSets" INTEGER NOT NULL,"minReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"maxReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"defaultRestSeconds" INTEGER NOT NULL,"defaultIncrement" DECIMAL(6,2) NOT NULL,"userNotes" TEXT,"archived" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "ExerciseImage" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"exerciseId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Exercise"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"path" TEXT NOT NULL,"caption" TEXT,"sortOrder" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"isPrimary" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutProgram" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id"),"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"active" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"preferredWeekdays" INTEGER[] NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutTemplate" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"programId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "WorkoutProgram"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"name" TEXT NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutTemplateExercise" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"templateId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "WorkoutTemplate"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"exerciseId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Exercise"("id"),"sortOrder" INTEGER NOT NULL,"sets" INTEGER NOT NULL,"minReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"maxReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"restSeconds" INTEGER NOT NULL,"increment" DECIMAL(6,2) NOT NULL,UNIQUE("templateId","exerciseId"));
CREATE TABLE "Machine" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id"),"exerciseId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Exercise"("id"),"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"gym" TEXT,"manufacturer" TEXT,"model" TEXT,"machineNumber" TEXT,"availableWeights" DECIMAL[] NOT NULL,"weightIncrement" DECIMAL(6,2),"seatSetting" TEXT,"backrestSetting" TEXT,"notes" TEXT,"images" TEXT[] NOT NULL,"archived" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutSession" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id"),"templateId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "WorkoutTemplate"("id"),"startedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"finishedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"notes" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',"clientMutationId" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutExercise" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"sessionId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "WorkoutSession"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"exerciseId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Exercise"("id"),"machineId" TEXT REFERENCES "Machine"("id"),"sortOrder" INTEGER NOT NULL,"plannedSets" INTEGER NOT NULL,"minReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"maxReps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"restSeconds" INTEGER NOT NULL,"exerciseNameSnapshot" TEXT NOT NULL,"machineSettingsSnapshot" JSONB);
CREATE TABLE "WorkoutSet" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"workoutExerciseId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "WorkoutExercise"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"setNumber" INTEGER NOT NULL,"weight" DECIMAL(6,2) NOT NULL,"reps" INTEGER NOT NULL,"rir" INTEGER,"completedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"clientMutationId" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,UNIQUE("workoutExerciseId","setNumber"));
CREATE TABLE "BodyWeightEntry" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "User"("id"),"date" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"weight" DECIMAL(6,2) NOT NULL,"notes" TEXT,UNIQUE("userId","date"));
